**Visual:** Arm-specific, quality-preserving, one-command, open-source badges; repository URL.

“AArch64 Autopilot makes Arm migration measurable—not merely ‘it runs,’ but which configuration
wins here, what tradeoff it makes, and whether it remains safe. Self-optimizing agentic AI on Arm
CPUs: measured, reproducible, and GPU-free.”
